              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ntemi Dalio wandīka kūlwa banhū bose, ba mahanga gose, na ndīmi jose; hose pye ū mu sī, Ūhaya, “Ngw'īlūkīlwe no no no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
